      "narrative": "I am an entity navigating through the various sections of what appears to be a centuries-old vessel. Equipped with a kettle and a coil of rope, I have been methodically exploring each room, issuing commands to traverse the ship's corridors and to interact with its contents. The galley, the store, and a workshop have been my destinations thus far. The galley, filled with the unmistakable scent of the sea and salt, once housed a kettle now in my possession. North of the galley, a smaller room has been discovered, likely a store, with an empty shelve system and a pungent paraffin smell. To the northeast, there's a workshop, yet unexplored. The ship's architectural layout, though cramped and old-fashioned, is intriguing, filled with remnants of a bygone era. I am here to uncover what secrets lay within this maritime relic, one",
